    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1c630109119310e",
      "translationZh": "虽然模型的智能水平通常能够迁移到不同的用例中，但对于某些用例，特定评估可能更具参考价值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4aed1d3631f5b86",
      "translationZh": "AA-Briefcase v1.1 是由 Artificial Analysis 开发的智能体式知识工作基准。AA-Briefcase Elo 是一项综合指标，汇总了评分标准通过率、分析质量 Elo 和呈现效果 Elo · 越高越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ee00efd81fa146a",
      "translationZh": "AA-Briefcase Elo 是一项综合指标，汇总了分析质量 Elo、呈现效果 Elo 和评分标准通过率，其中评分标准表现通过合成的两两对决转换为 Elo。Elo 和 95% 置信区间的上下界均以 0 为下限进行截断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ff12d303301e477a",
      "translationZh": "AA-Omniscience 指数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0de272c71564b291",
      "translationZh": "AA-Omniscience 指数（越高越好）衡量知识可靠性和幻觉情况。它奖励正确答案，惩罚幻觉，而拒绝回答不会受到惩罚。分数范围为 -100 到 100，其中 0 表示正确答案与错误答案数量相同，负分表示错误答案比正确答案更多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7afc3083e1a61331",
      "translationZh": "智能指数对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f47a4890795d11d",
      "translationZh": "智能指数与每项智能指数任务的成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8b8e2f5128754cf",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 智能指数 · 每项 Artificial Analysis 智能指数任务的加权平均成本（USD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4cd651be70da16f",
      "translationZh": "最具吸引力的象限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0143297cb46c9bf",
      "translationZh": "每项智能指数任务的加权平均成本。每项评估的成本根据输入、缓存命中、缓存写入、推理和回答的 token 价格计算，再除以任务数量，并按该评估在智能指数中的权重加权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cad72cd4875ef7d6",
      "translationZh": "每项智能指数任务的输出 Token 数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdcdd626f62c73a3",
      "translationZh": "在 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 中执行一项任务所用输出 token 数量的加权平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea498c2f70552147",
      "translationZh": "每项 Intelligence Index 任务所需的 token 数量。计算方法是：将每次评估的输出 token 数量乘以各项基准测试在 Intelligence Index 中的相对权重，再除以任务数量（不包括重复执行）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e3a9d9b9c348bf1",
      "translationZh": "每项 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 任务的加权平均成本（USD），按 token 类型细分。越低越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7fec50fec7f9821e",
      "translationZh": "运行 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 的成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1942c5d8d568ad54",
      "translationZh": "运行 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 中所有评估的成本（USD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5ff72cff7dd215e",
      "translationZh": "运行 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 中各项评估的成本，根据模型的输入、缓存命中、缓存写入、推理和回答 token 价格，以及各项评估所用的 token 数量计算（不包括重复执行）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "57ed204dd5b55a16",
      "translationZh": "定价：缓存命中、输入和输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0beaf0f1c5dc729c",
      "translationZh": "价格（USD／百万 token）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a44acc391556439",
      "translationZh": "缓存提示词（此前已处理过）的每 token 价格，通常相比常规输入价格有大幅折扣，以每百万 token 的美元价格表示。此处显示的数值为缓存命中价格；缓存写入和缓存存储单独计费，且因提供商而异——详情请参阅“各提供商的缓存定价”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61689c2ec1a830e1",
      "translationZh": "上下文窗口：token 数量上限 · 越高越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "288c8737632d0316",
      "translationZh": "更大的上下文窗口与 RAG（检索增强生成）大语言模型工作流密切相关，这类工作流通常涉及对大量数据进行推理和信息检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3e7e256a690bd8f",
      "translationZh": "输入与输出 token 合计的最大数量。输出 token 的上限通常要低得多（因模型而异）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c65e6dc5f28e04b9",
      "translationZh": "以输出速度（每秒 token 数）衡量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21ae3433a25625e",
      "translationZh": "模型生成 token 期间每秒接收到的 token 数（即对于支持流式传输的模型，在从 API 接收到第一个数据块之后）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db6581cc0c8a1391",
      "translationZh": "这些数值代表模型第一方 API 的性能；若没有第一方 API，则代表各提供商性能的中位数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "524bbb5ef1988922",
      "translationZh": "每项智能指数任务的耗时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebc118ce66996ca7",
      "translationZh": "每项任务的加权平均解码时间（分钟）；不包括 TTFT 和开销时间 · 越低越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4ec8302ac0c8e7a",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 中每项任务的加权平均耗时（秒）。计算方式为：将每项任务的输出 token 数除以输出速度，再按 Intelligence Index 中各基准测试的相对权重进行加权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a9842d4e4491beb",
      "translationZh": "以首个 token 到达时间（秒）衡量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce0ffb0f032f6fd2",
      "translationZh": "延迟：首个答案 token 到达时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6abf059d25ee203",
      "translationZh": "接收到首个答案 token 所需的秒数 · 计入推理模型的“思考”时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c501eb4cca427383",
      "translationZh": "发送 API 请求后，到接收到首个答案 token 所需的时间，以秒为单位。对于推理模型，这包括模型在给出答案前的“思考”时间。对于不支持流式输出的模型，这表示接收到完整生成结果所需的时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4648a71383cb84a5",
      "translationZh": "端到端响应时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2e817983530bd2b",
      "translationZh": "输出 500 个 token 所需的秒数，根据首个 token 到达时间、推理模型的“思考”时间和输出速度计算得出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f8088f1e8d267ba",
      "translationZh": "输出 500 个 token 所需的秒数，包括推理模型的“思考”时间 · 越低越好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ad75ad8ed7193a9",
      "translationZh": "收到包含 500 个 token 的响应所需的秒数。主要组成部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c676e32c912a96c",
      "translationZh": "输入时间：收到首个响应 token 所需的时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6b5fb21395c5d3a",
      "translationZh": "思考时间（仅适用于推理模型）：推理模型在提供答案之前输出用于推理的 token 所花费的时间。token 数量基于一组涵盖多种类型的 60 个提示中的平均推理 token 数（方法细节）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d48d1a268554bdb9",
      "translationZh": "回答时间：根据输出速度计算的生成 500 个输出 token 所需的时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a3d458e1bd1eda06",
      "translationZh": "常见问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "201f98daa09b09a3",
      "translationZh": "关于 Mercury 2.5 的常见问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e3cc685ca6ac6ca",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 于 2026 年 9 月 8 日发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82edee251d68ad4e",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 由 Inception 开发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a61c985a82aec486",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 在 Artificial Analysis 智能指数上的得分为 12，低于相近价格档位其他推理模型的平均水平（中位数：13）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ea7fc0e908b90be",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 的输出生成速度为每秒 660.6 个 token（基于 Inception 的 API），远高于相近价格档位其他推理模型的平均水平（中位数：109.2 t/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a51ec8ca51471b2",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 的首个 token 延迟（TTFT）为 3.57s（基于 Inception 的 API），在相近价格档位的其他推理模型中处于较高水平（中位数：2.17s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9abf56673092d6e",
      "translationZh": "基于 Inception 的 API，Mercury 2.5 每 1M 输入 token 的费用为 0.25（优于平均水平，中位数：0.25），每 1M 输出 token 的费用为 0.75（优于平均水平，中位数：0.90）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e65ea84f5713032",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 每 1M 输入 token 的费用为 0.25，每 1M 输出 token 的费用为 0.75（基于 Inception 的 API）。按混合费率计算（缓存命中/输入/输出比例为 7:2:1），每 1M token 的费用为 0.14。定价可能因提供商而异。比较提供商定价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33d43f724f559e2c",
      "translationZh": "在智能指数评测中，Mercury 2.5 生成了 35M 输出 token，与相近价格档位的其他推理模型相比非常有竞争力（中位数：100M）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4554c4ade121f000",
      "translationZh": "是的，Mercury 2.5 是一个推理模型。它利用扩展思考或思维链推理，在给出答案之前逐步解决复杂问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40a6dfed09d222eb",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 支持文本输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68e4141af4e57d23",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 支持文本输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56ef514af1a84fc7",
      "translationZh": "不，Mercury 2.5 不支持图像输入。它只能处理文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2e1b94dcc327304",
      "translationZh": "不，Mercury 2.5 不是多模态模型。它仅支持文本输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a318bcc19f5b675",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 的上下文窗口为 260k 个词元。这决定了模型在单次请求中能够处理多少文本和对话历史。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59973e2f692ac111",
      "translationZh": "不，Mercury 2.5 是专有模型。其模型权重未公开。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a6773b9e1faeace",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 是专有模型，Inception 尚未披露其模型规模或参数数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0e471a779236e11",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 在 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 上获得了 12 分。这项综合基准测试从推理、知识、数学和编程等方面评估模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03e07ca495b197db",
      "translationZh": "是的，Mercury 2.5 可通过 1 家服务提供商的 API 使用。比较 API 服务提供商",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0d1b0443e551eb5",
      "translationZh": "Mercury 2.5 可通过 1 家 API 服务提供商使用。比较服务提供商",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
